      "widgets_values": [
        "For the target video, at 0.00 seconds into the target video, <Picture 1> (from [Shot 1]) is fully referenced.\n\nintegrated_multimodal_description: [Shot 1] Clean 2D anime illustration. Begin with the exact young woman, hairstyle, white shirt, dark tie, pleated skirt, tights, seated pose, classroom window, and daylight shown in <Picture 1>. In one continuous shot she lowers her legs from the desk, plants her feet, and stands up. The young woman (S1), in a clear, gentle Japanese voice with a bright, slightly nervous tone and a quick conversational pace, looks toward the camera and says: <d>[Japanese] ねえ、聞いて。</d> She takes a few steps toward the camera while maintaining her identity, outfit, and the classroom setting, and continues softly with a shy smile: <d>[Japanese] ずっと言えなかったけど、</d> As she reaches a closer framing, she looks directly into the lens, makes a small finger-heart with her thumb and index finger beside her face, and says with rising excitement: <d>[Japanese] 君のことが、好きなの！</d> Her mouth moves in sync with every exact line, and she holds the finger-heart briefly at the end.\n\noverall_soundscape: Light classroom ambience continues under the soft sounds of her feet landing and footsteps approaching the camera. Her clothes rustle gently as she stands and raises her hand.\n\nnon_diegetic_music: N/A",
